  "description": "Unable to activate his superpowers since graduating from the prestigious Hero Academy, Ron struggles to land a job as a superhero. One day, Ron accepts a mysterious job interview where he gets scouted by Darren. The job? Be Darren's personal assistant, who just happens to be the world's most notorious villain. But Darren turns out to be a great boss who cares deeply about his employees’ work-life balance, going so far as to brew morning coffee for them. The more involved Ron gets with the life of being a villain, the more he begins to question the conventional definitions of good and bad. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
